<title>SINGAPORE: Scotts reports S$1.21 mln 1st half net.</title>
<headline>Scotts reports S$1.21 mln 1st half net.</headline>
<text>
<p>SINGAPORE, March 31 - Six months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.21  vs   1.48 (loss)</p>
<p>    Interim dividend			nil  vs   0.60</p>
<p>    Group share			    0.51  vs   0.62 (loss)</p>
<p>    Turnover				33.87  vs  28.00</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	0.27  vs   0.77</p>
<p>    Interest expense		     4.50  vs   3.49</p>
<p>    Depreciation &amp; amortisation	2.40  vs   2.32</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 1.87  vs   0.82</p>
<p>    Income from associates	     1.07  vs   1.47 (loss)</p>
<p>    Tax					1.73  vs   0.82</p>
<p>Note - Scotts Holdings Ltd is a property and leisure group.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
